  "title": "The Pyke Defense",
  "description": "With all the Tusken tribe doing their part, the attack on the train began in earnest. It became obvious at this point that the repulsor train was being run by the Pyke Syndicate, an especially unscrupulous and galaxy-spanning organization of spice dealers. Tusken snipers laid down fire that picked off many of the Pyke gunners, but there were casualties for the Tusken Raiders too, both among the snipers and on the speeder bikes. Boba Fett, along with several of his co-riders, fought alongside the sleek train, and managed to climb up onto the roof, when more Pyke agents fought and fired upon them in a defensive maneuver."
